        "introduction": "This guide shows you the process of reinstalling a C-Clamp style Sternum Strap on a Patagonia backpack.\nThis particular Sternum Strap is called a \"C-Clamp\" because the cross section of the clips is shaped like a \"C\".",
        "image_url": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/wJIKBZ5hwGP3VwE6.140x105"
    },
